      <dict>
        <key>construction</key>
        <string>Retain the genuine same-cut closed SC bowl and its exact counter. Remove only the outward alpha foot beyond the actual right-stem line. Fit the upper native script-g descender to the actual extrapolated SC stem, blending back to the translated native descender below zero; the deep hook stays unchanged below the joining band. No ordinary capital G alias or whole-glyph scaling.</string>
