        <key>ordinaryLowercaseControl</key>
        <string>uni0251</string>
        <key>prototypeCorrection</key>
        <string>The rejected12% guide intersected the lower bowl/foot flare. The first35% successor repaired that topology but introduced small internal notches and italic baseline steps. This successor restores the exact SC counter and matches both stem edges through the baseline, blending to the unmodified deep tail.</string>
        <key>roleRationale</key>
        <string>The SC bowl has no inherited anchors. Add all five active Latin roles explicitly. Top/side/middle follow the actual SC frame/body; bottom follows the unchanged native descender ink-relative role and its x translation. The ogonek role deliberately shares that below-tail position. All new roles remain candidate hypotheses for actual mark/stack testing.</string>
